          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scrf",
          "text": "Insurance policies are legally binding contracts between the policyholder and the insurance company. The policyholder agrees to pay insurance premiums. In turn, the insurance company pledges to provide a defense for and pay the insured if an accident occurs that is covered within the policy.",
